      "no_speech_prob": 0.10871292650699615
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 7.2,
      "end": 10.6,
      "text": "有人跟你聊天看着随意 其实每句都在试探你的底",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23729534670710564,
      "compression_ratio": 1.396039603960396,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.10871292650699615
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 10.8,
      "end": 14.2,
      "text": "你以为自己在先聊 一不小心就把老底全交了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23729534670710564,
      "compression_ratio": 1.396039603960396,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.10871292650699615
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 14.4,
      "end": 18.0,
      "text": "当你反应过来 对方早就拿着你的话去做文章了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23729534670710564,
      "compression_ratio": 1.396039603960396,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.10871292650699615
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 18.4,
      "end": 20.4,
      "text": "不是你太单纯 是你没意识到",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23729534670710564,
      "compression_ratio": 1.396039603960396,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.10871292650699615
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 20.6,
      "end": 25.6,
      "text": "你说出去的东西就是丑马 职场 生意场 任何需要不意的地方",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23729534670710564,
      "compression_ratio": 1.396039603960396,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.10871292650699615
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 26.0,
      "end": 28.2,
      "text": "守不住嘴 就守不住主动权",
      "avg_logprob": -0.23729534670710564,
      "compression_ratio": 1.396039603960396,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.10871292650699615
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 28.6,
      "end": 31.0,
      "text": "很多人觉得被淘华是对方几乔高",
      "avg_logprob": -0.18527722880244255,
      "compression_ratio": 1.2951388888888888,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055515870451927185
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 31.4,
      "end": 34.6,
      "text": "其实是你自己太想说 太想被认同 怕冷场",
      "avg_logprob": -0.18527722880244255,
      "compression_ratio": 1.2951388888888888,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055515870451927185
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 35.2,
      "end": 39.4,
      "text": "你以为多数几句能拉进距离 结果只是把软内路的更清楚",
      "avg_logprob": -0.18527722880244255,
      "compression_ratio": 1.2951388888888888,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055515870451927185
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 40.0,
      "end": 42.8,
      "text": "六个防淘华的招 今天全说给你听",
      "avg_logprob": -0.18527722880244255,
      "compression_ratio": 1.2951388888888888,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055515870451927185
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 43.2,
      "end": 45.0,
      "text": "第一招 延迟回应",
      "avg_logprob": -0.18527722880244255,
      "compression_ratio": 1.2951388888888888,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055515870451927185
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 45.6,
      "end": 48.8,
      "text": "别人问你问题 别立刻打 停顿三秒",
      "avg_logprob": -0.18527722880244255,
      "compression_ratio": 1.2951388888888888,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.055515870451927185
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
